# No Cursor commit attribution

For the entire PROG7312 / Smart-X project:

- Do not add `Co-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>` or any Cursor / cursoragent trailer to commits or PRs.
- Do not pass `git commit --trailer` for Cursor attribution.
- Do not add "Made with Cursor" footers to commit messages or pull requests.
- Commit author must remain the student identity only (`RibaOrearabetse`).
- If a commit message still contains a Cursor co-author line, remove it before finishing.
